{"3902210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Laby's Village", "steam_appid": 3902210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Laby’s Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laby’s Village is a fantasy-comedy 2D pixel action roguelike featuring unique dungeon-driven mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Laby, an officer of the Demon King’s army.<br>In the chaotic era following the Demon King’s fall, you set out from a small village that safeguards the “Heart of the Demon King,” determined to conquer the ambitious warlords who refuse to submit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines fast-paced combat, weapon progression, and relic-based builds.<br>Purchase and upgrade a wide variety of weapons and Demon King relics to craft your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own attack rhythm, projectile effects, and humorous personality, while relic enhancements can trigger unexpected and wildly satisfying chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺 Unique Dungeon Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon features its own unique rules.<br>Different environments, mechanics, and bosses create completely different combat pacing and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Weapon × Relic Build System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run allows you to mix and match weapons and relics to create highly personalized builds.<br>From a self-returning Bone Boomerang to the meteor-summoning Starfall Bringer, every weapon comes with its own quirks and temperament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 Quirky — and Dangerous — Villagers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Elf Knight Commander “Blackheart,”<br>the Great Rat Sage “Squeakmaster,”<br>and the Dogfolk Traveling Merchant “Anna”…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers may seem ordinary at first glance—but they are anything but simple.<br>Perhaps they will help Laby grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Ruthless Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon has its own boss—<br>Goblin Warlords, Elf Queens, Kobold Consuls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None of them are nice.<br>They are all ambitious.<br>And every one of them looks down on Laby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 Fantasy × Comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Laby’s Village—a little run-down, yet full of absurd and lovable characters.<br>A world filled with humor, weirdness, and adventure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Laby’s Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laby’s Village is a fantasy-comedy 2D pixel action roguelike featuring unique dungeon-driven mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Laby, an officer of the Demon King’s army.<br>In the chaotic era following the Demon King’s fall, you set out from a small village that safeguards the “Heart of the Demon King,” determined to conquer the ambitious warlords who refuse to submit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines fast-paced combat, weapon progression, and relic-based builds.<br>Purchase and upgrade a wide variety of weapons and Demon King relics to craft your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own attack rhythm, projectile effects, and humorous personality, while relic enhancements can trigger unexpected and wildly satisfying chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺 Unique Dungeon Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon features its own unique rules.<br>Different environments, mechanics, and bosses create completely different combat pacing and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Weapon × Relic Build System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run allows you to mix and match weapons and relics to create highly personalized builds.<br>From a self-returning Bone Boomerang to the meteor-summoning Starfall Bringer, every weapon comes with its own quirks and temperament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 Quirky — and Dangerous — Villagers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Elf Knight Commander “Blackheart,”<br>the Great Rat Sage “Squeakmaster,”<br>and the Dogfolk Traveling Merchant “Anna”…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers may seem ordinary at first glance—but they are anything but simple.<br>Perhaps they will help Laby grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Ruthless Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon has its own boss—<br>Goblin Warlords, Elf Queens, Kobold Consuls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None of them are nice.<br>They are all ambitious.<br>And every one of them looks down on Laby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 Fantasy × Comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Laby’s Village—a little run-down, yet full of absurd and lovable characters.<br>A world filled with humor, weirdness, and adventure.</p>", "short_description": "Weary Wastelands, Malicious Forests, and Desolate Deserts... A 2D pixel action roguelike. 58 unique weapons and 277 Demon Relics let you create your own build. Cut through hordes and challenge unique bosses. Play as the goblin officer Laby on an absurd yet exhilarating conquest.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902210/ae7c329f0916e40c4fa8376b33599d1ca5387179/header.jpg?t=1784455076", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902210/6629c15126f536e41e724fc894eba443ca0afc0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784455076", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902210/6629c15126f536e41e724fc894eba443ca0afc0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784455076", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"